# @NAME@

This is a C# application for the rbfx engine. The C++ launcher starts the .NET runtime and loads the C# plugin
`@NAME@.Net`.

## Folders

- `CSharp` has the C# source of the plugin.
- `Data` has the resources of the application.
- `ResourceRoot.ini` maps the resource aliases to folders.

## Requirements

- CMake 3.28 or later and a C++ compiler.
- The .NET SDK.
- A shared rbfx engine SDK for desktop.
- The SharpCpp.Rbfx SDK.

## Configure and build

Replace `<RBFX_SDK>` with the path of the engine SDK. Replace `<SHARPCPP_RBFX_SDK>` with the path of the
SharpCpp.Rbfx SDK.

```
cmake -S . -B build -G Ninja -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Debug -DBUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON -DCMAKE_PREFIX_PATH="<RBFX_SDK>;<SHARPCPP_RBFX_SDK>"
cmake --build build
```

## Run

Start the executable `@NAME@` in the folder `build/bin`.
The log shows the line `C# plugin @NAME@.Net is loaded.`

## Install

```
cmake --install build --prefix <install folder>
```
